&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Verificar logs:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight-header flex flex-row justify-between"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;em class="fas fa-code me-2" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class="highlight-lang"&gt;bash&lt;/span&gt;
